   original sources listed in data/raw/SOURCES.md.

2. The third-party data in data/raw/, which keeps its provider's licence
   (Madrid City Council, INE, Wikidata). See data/raw/SOURCES.md.

3. The thesis text, which belongs to the author, is not MIT-licensed and is
   not currently included in this repository.

4. The OpenStreetMap data the notebooks download at runtime, subject to the
